  "recent_scripts": [
    {
      "source": "[GTA5]_Clip_6734.mp4",
      "script": "With GTA Six on the horizon, players are returning to the classics. We're cruising down the sun-soaked coastline before taking to the skies in a massive jet. The scale of this world still feels incredible today.",
      "created_at": "2026-11-23T02:44:22.614203+00:00"
    },
    {
      "source": "[GTA5]_Clip_6697.mp4",
      "script": "We are revisiting Los Santos as the hype for the next title reaches a fever pitch. From selecting grenades in the hills with Chop to Franklin\u2019s intense reactions, these classic moments define the experience.",
      "created_at": "2026-11-23T03:46:12.592953+00:00"
    },
    {
      "source": "[GTA5]_Clip_6723.mp4",
      "script": "We are pushing the limits of Los Santos while waiting for the next big release. From navigating alleys on bikes to sending trucks down steep ridges or ending up underwater, the physics engine still delivers absolute chaos.",
      "created_at": "2026-11-23T10:50:22.813667+00:00"
    },
    {
      "source": "[GTA6]_Clip_316.mp4",
      "script": "We are tracking down leads across this sprawling map, from checking motel walls for wanted posters to navigating tense domestic scenes. Whether you are cruising past vintage gold coupes or sprinting through palm-lined plazas, every detail matters.",
      "created_at": "2026-11-24T01:41:44.021074+00:00"
    },
    {
      "source": "[GTA5]_Clip_6697.mp4",
      "script": "CHOP DISAPPEARED IN SECONDS! Even a simple walk in Los Santos can go wrong. We are out in the hills with Franklin and Chop. It starts as a peaceful hike across this dry ridge, but watch what happens next. A random cloud of grey smoke suddenly erupts exactly where the dog was standing. There is no visible projectile or warning, just a quick explosion that leaves Franklin completely alone on the hillside. Is this a rare physics glitch or did the game just break? Tell us your theories, because CHOP DISAPPEARED IN SECONDS.",
      "created_at": "2026-11-24T04:29:54.547643+00:00"
    }
  ],
